## Interface: 120007
## Title: Ka0s Panel Master
## Notes: Draws backdrop panels behind your UI, so separate frames read as deliberate groups.
## Author: add1kted2ka0s
## Version: 0.1.0
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\inv_misc_food_legion_gooseraw
## SavedVariables: PanelMasterDB
## OptionalDeps: Ace3, LibStub, CallbackHandler-1.0, LibSharedMedia-3.0, AceGUI-3.0-SharedMediaWidgets
## DefaultState: enabled
## Category-enUS: UI
## X-License: MIT
## X-Standard: https://github.com/tusharsaxena/WowAddonStandards

